WEBVTT

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.440
Pai!!!

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.380
Pai!
Where are you!?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.270
Pai!

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.200
Pai! Pai!!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.800
Hold on, Pai!

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.550
Yakumo.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.540
Pai.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:30.570
Ya... Yakumo.

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.310
Yaku...

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.440
Pai.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.520
They had no reason to stay.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:04.900
They were waiting for us!

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:06.840
That's why...

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.080
I love humans!!

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.260
Two weeks have passed since we
took the Statue of Humanity back.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.310
Mrs. Wong has offered
to let us stay at her house...

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.570
and we are enjoying these
unexpectedly peaceful days.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.650
At this rate, it will take us
a while to complete the analysis.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.580
The secret of
Sanjiyan's humanization.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:50.620
Where could that secret
be hiding in such a small statue?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.490
Mrs. Wong!!

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.590
We're going shopping!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.730
I'll come, too!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.600
You're coming, Mei Shin?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.300
Yeah.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.340
You guys are not
familiar with Hong Kong.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.740
I'll show you around!

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:11.540
Damn...

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.910
I wanted some time alone with Pai.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:14.800
Did you say something?

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:15.950
Oh, nothing.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.650
OK, let's go!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:18.810
Let's go!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.820
A Sanjiyan and her Wu...

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.860
Keeping them around may
come in handy someday.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.050
Yes, Ma'am!

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:34.390
In case the Great Kaiyanwang
does not resurrect...

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.960
I will set that girl up
as the second Kaiyanwang.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.410
Shopping is fun!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.350
Don't go wandering off!
You'll get lost!

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.950
She's impossible.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.750
Hey, Yakumo.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.960
What are you going to do when
you become human again?

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.290
What do you mean?

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.020
Are you going back to Japan?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.490
Yes I'm going back.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.330
I see.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.650
Good looking crab!

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.750
What about Pai?
What is she going to do?

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.450
When she becomes human...

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.990
she'll probably go back to Tibet.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.030
But, if I asked her...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.900
Pai, come live with me in Japan!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.090
I'm so happy!
I love you, Yakumo!!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:51.900
Then we'd hug...

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.770
Just kidding...

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.320
Ya... Ya... Yakumo!!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.380
Yakumo!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.820
You OK?

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.330
Ouch.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:14.160
You're an immortal Wu, buck up!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.670
Hey, Pai!
Did you find anything?

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:00.170
Pai... what's wrong?

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:16.360
Wait!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.400
Yakumo?!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.050
You want something from me, boy?

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.350
Wu!?

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.790
There's another one?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.520
Comparing yourself with me,
I find that annoying.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.390
What was that!?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:04.300
Give up the Statue of Humanity.
It belongs to us.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.440
The Statue of Humanity?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.680
We will never give it to you!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:27.260
Benares, I will stop Kaiyanwang's
resurrection if it costs my life!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:29.130
Sanjiyan.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.500
Very well,
I will see you again.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.180
That's Kaiyanwang's Wu...

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:45.980
Isn't it?

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.750
Yakumo, what happened?
How did you get hurt!?

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.590
This is getting old.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:28.060
What is it, Yakumo?
Why the long face?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.840
Come to think of it, it's
a strange fate, you and Pai.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:46.210
Why does she want
to be human so badly?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.380
Is being human so great?

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:54.080
Try not being human for a while,
then you'll understand.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.520
And become a Wu?

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.220
It wouldn't be so bad to be
immortal and make tons of money!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.070
Hey, Yakumo!

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:25.880
The party to celebrate my brother's
recovery is about to start!

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:30.180
Oh, that's right.
I'll be there before it starts.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.920
Well, I'll dress up for a change!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:58.140
We're both Wu,
but what a difference.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.530
Looking pretty good.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.830
Now, the shoes...

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:06.120
What?

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:38.620
Mei Shin!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.490
No, don't!

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:52.790
Ouch...

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.890
You monster, using such
a cowardly device!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.550
Mei Shin!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.460
Mei Shin! Mei Shin!!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.170
Sanjiyan!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.060
It's not Takuhi.
Who are you?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.860
Be... Benares!

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:41.340
Bring the Statue of Humanity to
Aberdeen by tomorrow morning!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.840
Come alone.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.600
And are you going to kill me there?

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.170
I won't kill you.

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:50.580
I will place you in a deep sleep.
Your life will be preserved.

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:55.180
Once Kaiyanwang has resurrected,
I will reawaken you.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:00.250
You think that I will believe
such smooth talk?

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:02.750
Sanjiyan!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.860
You look well, boy.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:10.790
So it's you!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:14.340
You manipulated Mei Shin
to steal the Statue of Humanity!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.900
That was a mere distraction.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:18.470
What!?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.400
Listen well.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:27.590
If you do not want your precious
friends to end up like this...

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.850
you will do as I say.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.950
You have all night to think on it.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.370
Can you tell me in more detail...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.930
about Kaiyanwang and his Wu.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.650
Long ago, there was
an evil Sanjiyan...

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:04.490
who tried to rule
the world by violence.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.620
We, the other Sanjiyans,
tried to convince him against it...

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.790
but he regarded us as enemies
and massacred us in cold blood.

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:24.510
With Benares as his Wu,
Kaiyanwang had us all at his mercy.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.770
It was a living hell.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.840
In the end, the survivors
of our people...

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.420
decided to seal him
up in the holy land...

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:36.980
sacrificing our lives.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:01.380
When I came to,
I was the only one left.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.340
That's all I know.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:12.680
And that was
three hundred years ago.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.150
I thought that was the end of it.

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.690
Yakumo, we must fight!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.330
There is no way out.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.900
Either we defeat Benares,
or are defeated by him.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.830
As my Wu, I need your best!
You must be prepared to fight...

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:32.310
even unto death!

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:49.790
Mei Shin.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:53.960
Are you OK?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.160
Just barely.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.200
Should we call off the party?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.240
Sorry to do this to you Mrs. Wong,
after so much preparation...

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.340
but maybe we should postpone it.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:06.710
No, it's a celebration party
for your recovery.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:12.220
I'd feel terrible if it was called
off like this because of me.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.540
Mei Shin.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.620
I heard Pai saved me.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:23.030
Take very good care of Pai.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.890
Yes... I plan to.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:37.310
With your permission, I,
Ling-Ling Lee, propose a toast.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.870
In celebration of the full recovery
of Steve Long...

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.140
the greatest psychic
Hong Kong has ever produced.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.910
Cheers!

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.150
Thank you all.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:54.130
I hope our next party will be to
celebrate Pai becoming human.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:58.420
I will propose a toast then!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.370
There is no way out.

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.500
Either we defeat Benares,
or are defeated by him.

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:17.380
Do we even stand a chance?

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.120
If we lose...

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.110
Yakumo?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.190
Yakumo... Yakumo!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:43.800
What...

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.440
No picture!

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:49.080
It'll come up in a second.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.350
See.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.980
Hooray!
Yakumo and Pai in a picture!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.280
See this?
Look! Look! Look!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.420
Uh, yeah.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.480
They're both so happy,
it's love anyway you look at it.

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.830
I wish we could
make Pai human now.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.160
The two of us look!!

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.530
We have to win.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:22.810
So we begin this last battle...

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.680
Win it and become human...

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:29.650
so Pai and I can...

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:38.050
Yakumo.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:41.630
Pai.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.870
What's wrong?
What are you thinking, Yakumo?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:57.570
When I become human again,
I... I'm going back to Japan.

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.710
Yakumo's going away?

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:03.650
So, I was thinking...

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.480
would you come with me?

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:06.650
I...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.570
I... I think...

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:23.540
When we become human.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.340
I... I love...

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.990
When we become human...

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:45.330
Like I said, since you're immortal,
why don't we take advantage of it...

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:49.130
and do some monster
busting for profit?

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:53.800
No way!
I'm going to be human soon!

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:58.740
You seem so happy, Yakumo.
What happened?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.580
It's a secret!

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:04.020
Say, where's Pai?

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:09.520
She was right here a minute ago.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:13.050
Strange, maybe she went
back to her room.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:37.980
Yakumo...

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.050
Everybody...

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:42.920
I will come back
after defeating Benares.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:47.150
You knew about Benares, Pai.

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:50.790
Yes,
Takuhi's soul told me.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.430
It's foolish of you to go alone.

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.690
Yakumo... Ling-Ling...
All my gang.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.760
I don't want to get
my gang into trouble.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.230
Still...

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:07.670
for them... for Yakumo,
I will put my life at risk.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:09.300
Still...

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:15.310
What you don't know is,
if you really want to save Yakumo...

00:22:19.390 --> 00:22:20.290
Oh...

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:29.860
No!

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:31.330
Hey...

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:33.100
Never mind.

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:36.740
Let's go defeat Benares.

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:40.870
Then, you must return alive...

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.370
to Yakumo.

00:23:23.490 --> 00:23:24.390
Pai.

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:04.150
Why?

00:24:05.060 --> 00:24:08.520
Why did you go alone
without telling me?

00:24:36.630 --> 00:24:48.070
I gotta make it!

00:25:09.330 --> 00:25:10.450
Yakumo!

00:25:31.220 --> 00:25:33.550
Pai!!!

00:25:37.190 --> 00:25:38.680
What is that?

00:25:38.890 --> 00:25:40.880
It's coming from Aberdeen.

00:26:08.020 --> 00:26:11.050
Pai never came back to me.

00:26:27.970 --> 00:26:32.740
Yet, as long as I'm alive,
Pai must also be alive!

00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:37.080
This time, I'll find her,
just as she found me.

00:26:39.450 --> 00:26:41.940
No matter how many years it takes.

00:26:44.090 --> 00:26:44.990
Then...

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:47.880
Then... both of us...

00:26:49.890 --> 00:26:51.230
will become human!
